{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026U88mq3C1J61793778151.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>在北京，外交部被問到美國中期選舉對中美關係有何影響。</p><p></p><p>外交部發言人毛寧說：「中期選舉是美國內政，中方願繼續同美方一道，維護好、落實好兩國元首重要共識，加強溝通、妥處分歧、拓展合作，構建基於尊重、公平、對等的中美建設性戰略穩定關係。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T08:25:33.680216+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T07:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T09:38:34.246289+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:31.059117+00:00","content_hash":"d1639cda28a40302610cd7e4cad689ed638eea7b699da9a944b455c939fde268","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}